  { q: 'How do you enable WebMCP in Chrome?', a: 'For local development, run Chromium 146.0.7672.0 or later and turn on the enable-webmcp-testing flag. For a real site, register for the origin trial, which Chrome opened at version 149 and has scheduled to end at milestone 156, with 157 listed as the expected shipping milestone.' },
