    <h1>What Is WebMCP in Chrome, and <em>Should You Ship It Yet?</em></h1>
    <p class="dek">A page can now hand an AI agent a list of things it is allowed to do, instead of leaving the agent to guess which button is the checkout button. The idea is sound. The API moved house in May 2026, and most of the guides teaching it never noticed.</p>
    <div class="byline"><span><b>Best Answer Hub</b></span><span>~12 min read</span><span>Spec quoted at source</span><span>No signup</span></div>
