      <div class="seg b1">Real<small>Shipping in Chrome and Edge trials</small></div>
      <div class="seg b2">Draft<small>A Community Group report, not a standard</small></div>
      <div class="seg b3">Careful<small>The agent arrives already logged in as your user</small></div>
    </div>
  </div>
